## How to extend

| Artifact | Where to create | How to declare |
|---|---|---|
| Entity | \`examples/orders/domain/<name>.ts\` | \`@AgentEntity({ description, states })\` + \`@Invariant({ id, text })\` on the class |
| Entity method | in the entity class | \`@AgentMethod({ description, transition?, emits? })\`; rule guaranteed by the method: \`@Invariant\` on the method; helpers: \`#private\` |
| Event | \`examples/orders/domain/<aggregate>.events.ts\` | \`@AgentEvent({ description, payload })\` extending \`DomainEvent\` |
| Use-case | \`examples/orders/application/<name>.ts\` | \`@AgentUseCase({ name, description, whenToUse, input, output, uses: ['method:<Entity>.<method>'], emits? })\` |
| Operator | \`examples/orders/operators/<name>.operator.ts\` | \`@Operator({ name, description, instructions, useCases, requiresApproval? })\` |

A declared body that is not yet implemented uses \`notImplemented()\` from \`@agentic-ddd/core\`.

